📊 Interactive Dashboards (Plotly)
This project contains a set of interactive data dashboards built with Plotly to explore datasets visually.
The dashboards demonstrate interactive charting, clean layouts and dynamic data exploration.

📌 Features
Interactive Plotly visualizations
Dropdowns, filters and user-controlled views
Multiple charts displayed in a single dashboard
Clean and simple analytics UI

🛠 Tools Used
Python · Plotly · Pandas · NumPy · Jupyter Notebook

📁 Main File
Dashboards.ipynb — includes all interactive dashboard implementations
